  <text x="400" y="315" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" opacity="0.9">Sliding Door 90x215cm • Alexindo 1.2mm</text>
  
